## Book Of Heroes - Categories
dungeons.boh.category.longsword=Longswords
dungeons.boh.category_body.longsword=Standard weapons, used for their effective combat potential
dungeons.boh.category.katana=Katanas
dungeons.boh.category_body.katana=Powerful but frail weapons that slice through foes with ease
dungeons.boh.category.claymore=Claymores
dungeons.boh.category_body.claymore=Powerful and heavy swords that push mobs away like its nothing
dungeons.boh.category.cutlass=Cutlasses
dungeons.boh.category_body.cutlass=Swift blades used for taking over ships and the like
dungeons.boh.category.daggers=Daggers
dungeons.boh.category_body.daggers=Daggers are wielded by only the best ambidextrous fighters
dungeons.boh.category.rapier=Rapier
dungeons.boh.category_body.rapier=Swift and agile weapons that can take out a foe in a blink
dungeons.boh.category.glaive=Glaives
dungeons.boh.category_body.glaive=Powerful weapons used by ancient armies as they rushed onto the battlefield
dungeons.boh.category.battlestaff=Battlestaves
dungeons.boh.category_body.battlestaff=Any warrior who wants to wield one a staff like these must train for many moons
dungeons.boh.category.cleaving_axe=Axes
dungeons.boh.category_body.cleaving_axe=Cleaving Axes are made for chopping heads, not chopping trees
dungeons.boh.category.double_axe=Double Axes
dungeons.boh.category_body.double_axe=Those who wield double axes are known to amaze in combat
dungeons.boh.category.rush_spear=Spears
dungeons.boh.category_body.rush_spear=Specialised spears for warriors who are extraordinarily agile
dungeons.boh.category.coral_blade=Coral Blades
dungeons.boh.category_body.coral_blade=Weapons made by a deep sea civilsation long ago
dungeons.boh.category.tempest_knife=Tempest Knives
dungeons.boh.category_body.tempest_knife=These Knives channel the spirit of the mountains into each strike
dungeons.boh.category.soul_knife=Soul Knives
dungeons.boh.category_body.soul_knife=These weapons are often used to communicate with the dead
dungeons.boh.category.soul_scythe=Soul Scythes
dungeons.boh.category_body.soul_scythe=Scythes like these can rip a foes soul straight from its body
dungeons.boh.category.gauntlets=Gauntlets
dungeons.boh.category_body.gauntlets=Gauntlets are used for those who dont quite have the space in their hands for a blade
dungeons.boh.category.whip=Whips
dungeons.boh.category_body.whip=A marvel of weapon-forging like the Whip belongs in a museum
dungeons.boh.category.broken_sawblade=Sawblades
dungeons.boh.category_body.broken_sawblade=Sawblades can be used to deal intense damage, but be careful of using them to long, they might overheat!
dungeons.boh.category.great_hammer=Hammers
dungeons.boh.category_body.great_hammer=Hammers are wielded only by the strongest of warriors.. because they are quite hard to lift
dungeons.boh.category.iron_mace=Maces
dungeons.boh.category_body.iron_mace=Maces made of pure iron, still extremely heavy though
dungeons.boh.category.anchor=Anchors
dungeons.boh.category_body.anchor=Anyone who wields a weapon the size of themself should be feared in battle
dungeons.boh.category.boneclub=Boneclubs
dungeons.boh.category_body.boneclub=Thick clubs that can knock away enemies with ease
dungeons.boh.category.backstabber=Backstabbers
dungeons.boh.category_body.backstabber=Never be sure if someone bearing a Backstabber is truly on your side
dungeons.boh.category.void_touched_blades=Voided Blades
dungeons.boh.category_body.void_touched_blades=These blades drain thier foes life force with their strikes
dungeons.boh.category.obsidian_claymore=Obsidian Claymores
dungeons.boh.category_body.obsidian_claymore=The ultimate weapon for end exploration.. or smashing things to bits!
dungeons.boh.category.sickles=Sickles
dungeons.boh.category_body.sickles=Sickles are a ceremonial weapon used for quickly destroying foes
dungeons.boh.category.sharpened_pickaxe=Pickaxes
dungeons.boh.category_body.sharpened_pickaxe=Turns out they are good for more than just mining!


dungeons.boh.category.bow=Bows
dungeons.boh.category_body.bow=The classic choice!
dungeons.boh.category.longbow=Longbows
dungeons.boh.category_body.longbow=An effective long distance weapon that packs a punch
dungeons.boh.category.snow_bow=Snow Bows
dungeons.boh.category_body.snow_bow=Specialised bows that slow down their targets
dungeons.boh.category.soul_bow=Soul Bows
dungeons.boh.category_body.soul_bow=Bows that draw souls from their enemies body.. and beyond
dungeons.boh.category.wind_bow=Wind Bows
dungeons.boh.category_body.wind_bow=Magical bows that control the winds themselves
dungeons.boh.category.bubble_bow=Bubble Bows
dungeons.boh.category_body.bubble_bow=These special bows can trap foes into large bubbles
dungeons.boh.category.twisting_vine_bow=Vine Bows
dungeons.boh.category_body.twisting_vine_bow=Bows made of the most sickening and poisonous vines the Nether has to offer
dungeons.boh.category.void_bow=Void Bows
dungeons.boh.category_body.void_bow=These bows draw from the Void to debuff mobs
dungeons.boh.category.crossbow=Crossbows
dungeons.boh.category_body.crossbow=Efficient weapons that can be loaded and fired later on
dungeons.boh.category.burst_crossbow=Burst Crossbows
dungeons.boh.category_body.burst_crossbow=Burst Crossbows fire a volley of three arrows in a row
dungeons.boh.category.soul_crossbow=Soul Crossbows
dungeons.boh.category_body.soul_crossbow=Crossbows powered by forbidden necromancy
dungeons.boh.category.heavy_crossbow=Heavy Crossbows
dungeons.boh.category_body.heavy_crossbow=Mechanised Crossbows that have an extremely powerful shot
dungeons.boh.category.exploding_crossbow=Exploding Crossbows
dungeons.boh.category_body.exploding_crossbow=These Crossbows use gunpowder to detonate arrows on impact
dungeons.boh.category.scatter_crossbow=Scatter Crossbows
dungeons.boh.category_body.scatter_crossbow=Scatter Crossbows are useful for hitting lots of targets in one go
dungeons.boh.category.dual_crossbows=Dual Crossbows
dungeons.boh.category_body.dual_crossbows=With two crossbows in hand, you can shoot twice!
dungeons.boh.category.cog_crossbow=Cog Crossbows
dungeons.boh.category_body.cog_crossbow=The Cog Crossbows balance long wind-up times with extremely high damage output
dungeons.boh.category.harpoon_crossbow=Harpoon Crossbows
dungeons.boh.category_body.harpoon_crossbow=These specialised crossbows come with the ability to use any arrow in water
dungeons.boh.category.shadow_crossbow=Shadow Crossbows
dungeons.boh.category_body.shadow_crossbow=Shadow Crossbows allow whoever wields them to blink between this reality and the next
dungeons.boh.category.power_bow=Power Bows
dungeons.boh.category_body.power_bow=These bows can fire extremely strong arrows in the blink of an eye
dungeons.boh.category.shortbow=Shortbows
dungeons.boh.category_body.shortbow=Great choices for firing arrows quickly
dungeons.boh.category.trickbow=Trickbows
dungeons.boh.category_body.trickbow=The best choice for taking lots of targets out in one go
dungeons.boh.category.rapid_crossbow=Rapid Crossbows
dungeons.boh.category_body.rapid_crossbow=Rapid Crossbows can be loaded at *rapid* speeds!
dungeons.boh.category.hunting_bow=Hunting Bows
dungeons.boh.category_body.hunting_bow=These bows have been used for ages to signify the leader of the hunt.

dungeons.boh.category.dark=Dark Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.dark=Menacing suits of armour that provide great defensive power
dungeons.boh.category.plate=Plate Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.plate=These armour sets are so heavy and durable that it can slow you down
dungeons.boh.category.guard=Guard Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.guard=Nimble armour that is great for any combat situation
dungeons.boh.category.snow=Snow Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.snow=Armours made of ice and snow that, ironically, protect against the cold
dungeons.boh.category.champions=Champion's Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.champions=These armour sets are not only powerful, but stunning too
dungeons.boh.category.emerald=Emerald Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.emerald=Emerald Armour bears the special property of collecting extra experience from defeated monsters
dungeons.boh.category.piglin=Piglin Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.piglin=Armour sets inspired by the brutal Piglin tribes of the Nether
dungeons.boh.category.shulker=Shulker Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.shulker=The sturdiest of armours, being made of Shulker Shells adds extra protection from projectiles
dungeons.boh.category.teleportation=Teleportation Robe Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.teleportation=These robes are styled after a legendary fighter who worshipped a great shadow that lurked in the void
dungeons.boh.category.thief=Thief Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.thief=These agile clothes are great for attacking quickly and staying undetected
dungeons.boh.category.grim=Grim Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.grim=Armour that uses the bones of fallen warriors to channel Souls more effectively
dungeons.boh.category.ghostly=Ghostly Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.ghostly=A magical property of these Armours allows you to turn completely invisible as you move!
dungeons.boh.category.root_rot=Root Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.root_rot=The strange plants that make up these armour sets can provide lots of helpful bonuses as you heal
dungeons.boh.category.sprout=Sprout Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.sprout=Sprout Armour was first designed by a group of nomads lost in the Nether.. it reeks
dungeons.boh.category.evocation=Evocation Robes
dungeons.boh.category_body.evocation=These robes are used to mark those who are well trained in their magical abilities
dungeons.boh.category.entertainers=Bard Outfits
dungeons.boh.category_body.entertainers=Stylish, well fitting and absolutely gorgeous... not sure about "practical" though
dungeons.boh.category.wolf=Wolf Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.wolf=Wearing the pelt of an animal calls back to more primal fighting style from ancient times
dungeons.boh.category.ocelot=Ocelot Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.ocelot=Ocelot Armours let you take advantage of the high speed that comes with being a big cat
dungeons.boh.category.squid=Squid Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.squid=Made from dried ink, these armours will still blind any thing that it doesnt like
dungeons.boh.category.turtle=Turtle Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.turtle=Turtle Scutes are more durable than you might think!
dungeons.boh.category.phantom=Phantom Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.phantom=Dont wear Phantom Armour for too long, you might start losing sleep over it!
dungeons.boh.category.beenest=Bee Armour Sets
dungeons.boh.category_body.beenest=These armours are full of little bees who love to help fight! Who doesnt want a bunch of friends inside of-... ummm.. their armour.
dungeons.boh.category.soul=Soul Robes
dungeons.boh.category_body.soul=Special Robes that are garunteed to grant a soul after defeating a foe
dungeons.boh.category.battle=Battle Robes
dungeons.boh.category_body.battle=Battle Robes were created by Illagers to allow for magical profficiency in combat.
dungeons.boh.category.spelunker=Spelunker Armours
dungeons.boh.category_body.spelunker=These sets of armour is suited for both Mining AND Crafting.
dungeons.boh.category.mercenary=Mercenary Armours
dungeons.boh.category_body.mercenary=Armour designed for warriors and assasins who want to get the job done quickly.
dungeons.boh.category.climbing=Climbing Gears
dungeons.boh.category_body.climbing=These outfits are made for those who want to brave the most deadly terrain.
dungeons.boh.category.reinforced_mail=Reinforced Mail Armours
dungeons.boh.category_body.reinforced_mail=An incredibly sturdy kind of armours that can survive for a hundred battles.
dungeons.boh.category.mystery=Mystery Armours
dungeons.boh.category_body.mystery=Who knows where this armour comes from, but analysis reveals it is made of a material not native to any known world..
dungeons.boh.category.scale_mail=Scale Mail Armours
dungeons.boh.category_body.scale_mail=Hardy armour fit for many kinds of Warrior.
dungeons.boh.category.hunters=Hunting Armours
dungeons.boh.category_body.hunters=Rustic and comfortable, often worn for those hunting all sorts of beasts.. Ancient or not




dungeons.boh.category.artefact=Artefacts
dungeons.boh.category_body.artefact=Special reusable trinkets that activate various abilities. Artefacts with a special name colour have improved effects!

## Book of Heroes - Items (Translator note: all descriptions here are from Minecraft Dungeons itself, so maybe use the wiki!)

dungeons.boh.title.longsword=Longsword
dungeons.boh.body.longsword=A sturdy and reliable blade.
dungeons.boh.title.diamond_longsword=Diamond Longsword
dungeons.boh.body.diamond_longsword=The Diamond Longsword is the true mark of a hero and an accomplished adventurer.
dungeons.boh.title.hawkbrand=Hawkbrand
dungeons.boh.body.hawkbrand=The Hawkbrand is the legendary sword of proven warriors.
dungeons.boh.title.sinister_sword=§dSinister Sword
dungeons.boh.body.sinister_sword=The Sinister Sword, drawn to those who face the spookiest of nights, cuts through the night with a howl.

dungeons.boh.title.katana=Katana
dungeons.boh.body.katana=A blade fit for expert warriors and fighters, its blade is crafted to inflict precision damage.
dungeons.boh.title.masters_katana=Master's Katana
dungeons.boh.body.masters_katana=The Master's Katana has existed throughout the ages, appearing to heroes at the right moment.
dungeons.boh.title.dark_katana=Dark Katana
dungeons.boh.body.dark_katana=A blade that will not rest until the battle has been won.

dungeons.boh.title.claymore=Claymore
dungeons.boh.body.claymore=A massive sword that seems impossibly heavy to lift yet rests easily in a just warrior's hands.
dungeons.boh.title.broadsword=Broadsword
dungeons.boh.body.broadsword=Only those with the strength of a champion and the heart of a hero can carry this massive blade.
dungeons.boh.title.great_axeblade=Great Axeblade
dungeons.boh.body.great_axeblade=A lucky blacksmith turned a workshop blunder into a battlefield wonder, fusing two weapons into something new.
dungeons.boh.title.heartstealer=Heartstealer
dungeons.boh.body.heartstealer=Gifted to one of the Arch-Illager's most distinguished generals upon their conquest of the Squid Coast - this runeblade is infused with dark witchcraft.

dungeons.boh.title.cutlass=Cutlass
dungeons.boh.body.cutlass=This curved blade, wielded by the warriors of the Squid Coast, requires a steady hand in battle.
dungeons.boh.title.nameless_blade=Nameless Blade
dungeons.boh.body.nameless_blade=This deadly blade's story was lost to the endless sands of time.
dungeons.boh.title.dancers_sword=Dancer's Sword
dungeons.boh.body.dancers_sword=Warriors who view battle as a dance with death prefer double-bladed swords.
dungeons.boh.title.sparkler=§dSparkler
dungeons.boh.body.sparkler=The Sparkler lights up the party as it cuts through the darkness.

dungeons.boh.title.daggers=Daggers
dungeons.boh.body.daggers=Daggers are the weapon of cravens - or so folk say.
dungeons.boh.title.frost_knives=Fangs of Frost
dungeons.boh.body.frost_knives=These lauded twin daggers of the northern mountains are known to freeze their foes to solid ice.
dungeons.boh.title.moon_daggers=Moon Daggers
dungeons.boh.body.moon_daggers=These curved blades shine like the crescent moon on a dark night.
dungeons.boh.title.sheer_daggers=Sheer Daggers
dungeons.boh.body.sheer_daggers=Even the simplest of farmers can wield these Sheer Daggers with savage results.

dungeons.boh.title.rapier=Rapier
dungeons.boh.body.rapier=The rapier, a nimble and narrow blade, strikes with quick ferocity.
dungeons.boh.title.freezing_foil=Freezing Foil
dungeons.boh.body.freezing_foil=This needle-like blade is ice cold to the touch and makes quick work of any cut.
dungeons.boh.title.bee_stinger=Bee Stinger
dungeons.boh.body.bee_stinger=The Bee Stinger, a swift blade inspired by a bee's barb, can draw friendly bees into the fray to fight alongside you.

dungeons.boh.title.glaive=Glaive
dungeons.boh.body.glaive=The glaive, wielded by the servants of the Nameless One, is a weapon with style and power.
dungeons.boh.title.grave_bane=Grave Bane
dungeons.boh.body.grave_bane=A relic from ages of darkness; this glaive radiates potent magical energy to ward off the undead.
dungeons.boh.title.venom_glaive=Venom Glaive
dungeons.boh.body.venom_glaive=A toxic cloud seems to follow the Venom Glaive wherever it goes...
dungeons.boh.title.cackling_broom=§dCackling Broom
dungeons.boh.body.cackling_broom=Sweep your enemies off their feet with the Cackling Broom.

dungeons.boh.title.battlestaff=Battlestaff
dungeons.boh.body.battlestaff=The battlestaff is a perfectly balanced staff that is ready for any battle
dungeons.boh.title.battlestaff_of_terror=Battlestaff of Terror
dungeons.boh.body.battlestaff_of_terror=This staff overwhelms its target in battle to explosive effect.
dungeons.boh.title.growing_staff=Growing Staff
dungeons.boh.body.growing_staff=A staff that grows and shifts as it attacks, the Growing Staff is unpredictable and powerful.

dungeons.boh.title.cleaving_axe=Cleaving Axe
dungeons.boh.body.cleaving_axe=The axe is an effective weapon, favored by the relentless Vindicators of the Arch-Illager's army.
dungeons.boh.title.firebrand=Firebrand
dungeons.boh.body.firebrand=Crafted in the blackest depths of the Fiery Forge and enchanted with fiery powers.
dungeons.boh.title.highland_axe=Highland Axe
dungeons.boh.body.highland_axe=Expertly crafted and a polished weapon of war, the Highland Axe also makes a daring backscratcher.

dungeons.boh.title.double_axe=Double Axe
dungeons.boh.body.double_axe=A devastating weapon fit for barbaric fighters.
dungeons.boh.title.cursed_axe=Cursed Axe
dungeons.boh.body.cursed_axe=This cursed, poisonous axe leaves their victims sick for years with just a single scratch.
dungeons.boh.title.whirlwind=Whirlwind
dungeons.boh.body.whirlwind=Whirlwind, forged during an epic windstorm, is a double-bladed axe that levitates slightly.

dungeons.boh.title.rush_spear=Rush Spear
dungeons.boh.body.rush_spear=The spear, with its long reach and powerful range, is a solid choice of weapon.
dungeons.boh.title.fortune_spear=Fortune Spear
dungeons.boh.body.fortune_spear=A spear that is watched over by lucky souls, bringing luck to any who wield it.
dungeons.boh.title.whispering_spear=Whispering Spear
dungeons.boh.body.whispering_spear=Legend says that this cursed spear is plagued by a soul that controls the mind of any who wield it.
dungeons.boh.title.spine_chill_spear=§dSpine-Chill Spear
dungeons.boh.body.spine_chill_spear=The creator of this terrible weapon was said to have an affinity for giant eyes. Thankfully, this weapon was the extent of their madness.

dungeons.boh.title.coral_blade=Coral Blade
dungeons.boh.body.coral_blade=The Coral Blade cuts through enemies with stinging accuracy.
dungeons.boh.title.sponge_striker=Sponge Striker
dungeons.boh.body.sponge_striker=This blade may look colorless and dead, but it soaks up energy in combat and expels it in a powerful burst.

dungeons.boh.title.tempest_knife=Tempest Knife
dungeons.boh.body.tempest_knife=This knife slices through enemies like the wind that cuts between the mountaintops.
dungeons.boh.title.chill_gale_knife=Chill Gale Knife
dungeons.boh.body.chill_gale_knife=Crafted from the never-melting ice atop the mountain peaks, this knife is forever icy to the touch.
dungeons.boh.title.resolute_tempest_knife=Resolute Tempest Knife
dungeons.boh.body.resolute_tempest_knife=Passed down by nomads who roam the mountain peaks, this knife has been used in countless battles.

dungeons.boh.title.soul_knife=Soul Knife
dungeons.boh.body.soul_knife=A ceremonial knife that uses magical energy to hold the wrath of souls inside its blade.
dungeons.boh.title.eternal_knife=Eternal Knife
dungeons.boh.body.eternal_knife=A disturbing aura surrounds this knife, as if it has existed for all time and will outlive us all.
dungeons.boh.title.truthseeker=Truthseeker
dungeons.boh.body.truthseeker=The warden of Highblock Keep kept this unpleasant blade by their side during interrogations.

dungeons.boh.title.soul_scythe=Soul Scythe
dungeons.boh.body.soul_scythe=A cruel reaper of souls, the Soul Scythe is unsentimental in its work.
dungeons.boh.title.frost_scythe=Frost Scythe
dungeons.boh.body.frost_scythe=The Frost Scythe is an indestructible blade that is freezing to the touch and never seems to melt.
dungeons.boh.title.jailors_scythe=Jailor's Scythe
dungeons.boh.body.jailors_scythe=This scythe belonged to the terror of Highblock Keep, the Jailor.
dungeons.boh.title.skull_scythe=§dSkull Scythe
dungeons.boh.body.skull_scythe=Don't ask what unnatural creature's bones were used to build this weapon. You don't want to know.

dungeons.boh.title.gauntlets=Gauntlets
dungeons.boh.body.gauntlets=Gauntlets call back to an ancient style of hand to hand combat.
dungeons.boh.title.fighters_bindings=Fighter's Bindings
dungeons.boh.body.fighters_bindings=Made in the wilds beyond the mountains, these gauntlets have been worn by warriors for centuries.
dungeons.boh.title.maulers=Maulers
dungeons.boh.body.maulers=These claw-like weapons, wielded by ancient Illager soldiers, are savage in battle.
dungeons.boh.title.soul_fists=Soul Fists
dungeons.boh.body.soul_fists=Soul Fists are gauntlets clad with great gemstones, each containing a powerful soul.

dungeons.boh.title.whip=Whip
dungeons.boh.body.whip=A whip made of sturdy rope, very dangerous in the right hands.
dungeons.boh.title.vine_whip=Vine Whip
dungeons.boh.body.vine_whip=A sturdy whip made from thick, thorn-laden vines capable of poisoning anything it touches. Be careful not to scratch yourself!

dungeons.boh.title.broken_sawblade=Broken Sawblade
dungeons.boh.body.broken_sawblade=The Broken Sawblade has been ravaged by time, but it still does considerable damage.
dungeons.boh.title.mechanised_sawblade=Mechanised Sawblade
dungeons.boh.body.mechanised_sawblade=The Mechanized Sawblade still glows from the fires of the Nether where it was forged.

dungeons.boh.title.great_hammer=Great Hammer
dungeons.boh.body.great_hammer=Blacksmiths and soldiers alike use the Great Hammer for its strength in forging and in battle.
dungeons.boh.title.hammer_of_gravity=Hammer of Gravity
dungeons.boh.body.hammer_of_gravity=A hammer, embedded with a crystal that harnesses the power of gravity, that is incredibly powerful.
dungeons.boh.title.stormlander=Stormlander
dungeons.boh.body.stormlander=The Stormlander, enchanted with the power of the raging storm, is a treasure of the Illagers.
dungeons.boh.title.bonehead_hammer=§dBonehead Hammer
dungeons.boh.body.bonehead_hammer=Fashioned in the likeness of a familiar foe, this hammer pulls your opponents towards their doom.

dungeons.boh.title.iron_mace=Iron Mace
dungeons.boh.body.iron_mace=The Mace is a brutal tool of war and what it lacks in finesse; it makes up for in power.
dungeons.boh.title.suns_grace=Sun's Grace
dungeons.boh.body.suns_grace=This mace, engraved with secret healing runes, grants powerful restorative powers.
dungeons.boh.title.flail=Flail
dungeons.boh.body.flail=This ancient weapon inflicts grave blunt damage to those who cannot evade the deadly metal ball.

dungeons.boh.title.anchor=Anchor
dungeons.boh.body.anchor=Those strong enough to wield the Anchor in battle follow the tradition of legendary seafaring warriors
dungeons.boh.title.encrusted_anchor=Encrusted Anchor
dungeons.boh.body.encrusted_anchor=This Encrusted Anchor was lost at sea long ago and has become harsh and corrosive during its ages of neglect.

dungeons.boh.title.boneclub=Boneclub
dungeons.boh.body.boneclub=Those who wield a Bone Club prefer a less-subtle approach to problem-solving.
dungeons.boh.title.bone_cudgel=Bone Cudgel
dungeons.boh.body.bone_cudgel=The Bone Cudgel is old enough to be considered an ancient treasure, but still menacing even by modern standards.

dungeons.boh.title.backstabber=Backstabber
dungeons.boh.body.backstabber=The preferred blade of thieves and assassins, the Backstabber is a must in any rogue's pack.
dungeons.boh.title.swift_striker=Swift Striker
dungeons.boh.body.swift_striker=A blade for those who know that the surest way to victory is to strike without being seen.

dungeons.boh.title.void_touched_blades=Void Touched Blades
dungeons.boh.body.void_touched_blades=These Blades are infused with a disturbing purpose after countless ages trapped in the End.
dungeons.boh.title.the_beginning_and_the_end=The Beginning and The End
dungeons.boh.body.the_beginning_and_the_end=Forged by the survivors of a doomed expedition to the End, these twin blades carry dark secrets.

dungeons.boh.title.obsidian_claymore=Obsidian Claymore
dungeons.boh.body.obsidian_claymore=This massive blade cleaves even the thickest shulker shells with style and ease.
dungeons.boh.title.starless_night=The Starless Night
dungeons.boh.body.starless_night=The Starless Night is haunted by echoes of pain that linger within the pitch-black blade.

dungeons.boh.title.sickles=Sickles
dungeons.boh.body.sickles=A ceremonial weapon that hails from the same region as the Desert Temple.
dungeons.boh.title.the_last_laugh=The Last Laugh
dungeons.boh.body.the_last_laugh=Strange, distorted laughter seems to whisper from these menacing looking sickles.
dungeons.boh.title.nightmares_bite=Nightmare's Bite
dungeons.boh.body.nightmares_bite=The twin blades of Nightmare's Bite drip with deadly venom, still potent after all these years.

dungeons.boh.title.sharpened_pickaxe=Sharpened Pickaxe
dungeons.boh.body.sharpened_pickaxe=The pickaxe has been the iconic tool of adventurers and heroes for as long as anyone can remember.
dungeons.boh.title.sharpened_diamond_pickaxe=Sharpened Diamond Pickaxe
dungeons.boh.body.sharpened_diamond_pickaxe=Diamond is one of the most durable materials, making it an excellent choice for a pickaxe.
dungeons.boh.title.the_monkey_motivator=The Monkey Motivator
dungeons.boh.body.the_monkey_motivator=A strange weapon that makes a sound that no creature from the Overworld has ever made.


######ranged

dungeons.boh.title.bow=Bow
dungeons.boh.body.bow=A simple but well-rounded piece of weaponry. The hunters of the Pumpkin Pastures say that a bow doesn't let you down, unlike other trinkets.
dungeons.boh.title.bonebow=Bonebow
dungeons.boh.body.bonebow=The Bonebow is the pride of Pumpkin Pastures, crafted within the walls of their humble village.
dungeons.boh.title.twin_bow=Twin Bow
dungeons.boh.body.twin_bow=The Twin Bow is the champion of the hero who finds themselves outnumbered and alone.
dungeons.boh.title.haunted_bow=§dHaunted Bow
dungeons.boh.body.haunted_bow=What indescribable horror! The creeping tentacles of this bow reach for the unknowable Void.

dungeons.boh.title.longbow=Longbow
dungeons.boh.body.longbow=The Longbow, crafted for hunting rather than battle, is still useful in a fight.
dungeons.boh.title.guardian_bow=Guardian Bow
dungeons.boh.body.guardian_bow=Forged from fossilized coral, the Guardian Bow is a remnant from sunken civilizations of lost ages.
dungeons.boh.title.red_snake=Red Snake
dungeons.boh.body.red_snake=The Red Snake radiates an explosive heat, making it a deadly fire risk in the dry, desert lands.

dungeons.boh.title.snow_bow=Snow Bow
dungeons.boh.body.snow_bow=Those who face the Snow Bow in battle must also prepare to face the chill of freezing wintry winds.
dungeons.boh.title.winters_touch=Winter's Touch
dungeons.boh.body.winters_touch=Arrows fired from this legendary bow are said to be carried by the winter winds themselves.
dungeons.boh.title.webbed_bow=§dWebbed Bow
dungeons.boh.body.webbed_bow=Crafted from the webs of mighty spiders, the Webbed Bow will get you out of any sticky situation.

dungeons.boh.title.soul_bow=Soul Bow
dungeons.boh.body.soul_bow=The Soul Bow shimmers with all the beauty and fury of an attacking Vex.
dungeons.boh.title.nocturnal_bow=Nocturnal Bow
dungeons.boh.body.nocturnal_bow=The souls bound to the bow guide the arrows to their targets and cause it to glow slightly.
dungeons.boh.title.bow_of_lost_souls=Bow of Lost Souls
dungeons.boh.body.bow_of_lost_souls=This bow, made of cursed bones, strips the living of their very souls.

dungeons.boh.title.wind_bow=Wind Bow
dungeons.boh.body.wind_bow=A mesmerizing bow that captures the power of the wind to fire mighty Gale Arrows.
dungeons.boh.title.echo_of_the_valley=Echo of the Valley
dungeons.boh.body.echo_of_the_valley=This bow calls upon the twisting winds of the hidden valley where it was first strung.
dungeons.boh.title.burst_gale_bow=Burst Gale Bow
dungeons.boh.body.burst_gale_bow=A bow infused with the force of a rolling wind which can flare up in an instant.

dungeons.boh.title.bubble_bow=Bubble Bow
dungeons.boh.body.bubble_bow=Let your troubles float away with the Bubble Bow, which seals your target in a bubble on a charged shot.
dungeons.boh.title.bubble_burster=Bubble Burster
dungeons.boh.body.bubble_burster=The Bubble Burster creates a chain effect of bubble trouble for your enemies.
dungeons.boh.title.gloopy_bow=§dGloopy Bow
dungeons.boh.body.gloopy_bow=Entrap your enemies in a strange, syrupy bubble and show them who's boss!

dungeons.boh.title.twisting_vine_bow=Twisting Vine Bow
dungeons.boh.body.twisting_vine_bow=This bow writhes within your grasp as if trying to wrap its tendrils around everything in its path.
dungeons.boh.title.weeping_vine_bow=Weeping Vine Bow
dungeons.boh.body.weeping_vine_bow=The Weeping Vine Bow's toxic vines create a poisonous haze on the battlefield.

dungeons.boh.title.void_bow=Void Bow
dungeons.boh.body.void_bow=When you pluck the string of the Void Bow, an unsettling silence reverberates across the battlefield.
dungeons.boh.title.call_of_the_void=Call of the Void
dungeons.boh.body.call_of_the_void=You can feel the Void whispering from deep within this bow, but behind that sound is another voice in the darkness.

dungeons.boh.title.power_bow=Power Bow
dungeons.boh.body.power_bow=The question of what makes the Power Bow so powerful has puzzled the minds of learned folk for ages.
dungeons.boh.title.elite_power_bow=Elite Power Bow
dungeons.boh.body.elite_power_bow=The secrets of the Elite Power Bow's construction have been lost without a trace.
dungeons.boh.title.sabrewing=Sabrewing
dungeons.boh.body.sabrewing=This bow, built for a long-lost champion, feels right in the hands of those who seek justice.
dungeons.boh.title.phantom_bow=§dPhantom Bow
dungeons.boh.body.phantom_bow=The arrows that take flight from the Phantom Bow swoop down on your enemies like the bow's nightmarish namesake.

dungeons.boh.title.shortbow=Shortbow
dungeons.boh.body.shortbow=The preferred weapon of thieves and rogues, the Shortbow is nimble and lethal at short range.
dungeons.boh.title.purple_storm=Purple Storm
dungeons.boh.body.purple_storm=Named the Purple Storm after its lovely hue, this legendary bow packs a powerful punch.
dungeons.boh.title.mechanical_shortbow=Mechanical Shortbow
dungeons.boh.body.mechanical_shortbow=A brand new development in quick firing technology, this bow packs a swift punch.
dungeons.boh.title.love_spell_bow=Love Spell Bow
dungeons.boh.body.love_spell_bow=Love can be magical, but when it becomes too powerful, it can turn into a frenzy.

dungeons.boh.title.trickbow=Trickbow
dungeons.boh.body.trickbow=A sleek bow that seems to never miss its target.
dungeons.boh.title.the_pink_scoundrel=The Pink Scoundrel
dungeons.boh.body.the_pink_scoundrel=It would be a deadly mistake to underestimate the power of the Pink Scoundrel.
dungeons.boh.title.the_green_menace=The Green Menace
dungeons.boh.body.the_green_menace=The arrows fired from the Green Menace always hit their intended target, even in the thickest fog.
dungeons.boh.title.sugar_rush=§dSugar Rush
dungeons.boh.body.sugar_rush=This candy-colored bow has a surprisingly bitter bite.

dungeons.boh.title.hunting_bow=Hunting Bow
dungeons.boh.body.hunting_bow=This enchanted bow deepens the bond between the hunter and their trusted animal companion.
##hunters promise has the identical description to hunting bow - this is not a bug, and is accurate to its original game version
dungeons.boh.title.hunters_promise=Hunter's Promise
dungeons.boh.body.hunters_promise=This enchanted bow deepens the bond between the hunter and their trusted animal companion.
dungeons.boh.title.ancient_bow=Ancient Bow
dungeons.boh.body.ancient_bow=The Ancient Bow is still as sprightly as the day it was first strung.
dungeons.boh.title.masters_bow=Master's Bow
dungeons.boh.body.masters_bow=The bow preferred by the masters of archery across the Overworld, no matter how simple it appears.



dungeons.boh.title.crossbow=Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.crossbow=The crossbow is the ranged weapon of the Illagers and is a common sight among Pillager warriors.
dungeons.boh.title.azure_seeker=Azure Seeker
dungeons.boh.body.azure_seeker=If the color blue had a sound, it would be the shots fired by the Azure Seeker.
dungeons.boh.title.the_slicer=The Slicer
dungeons.boh.body.the_slicer=The peak of mischievous Illager-engineering, the famous Slicer was designed to fire bolts that pierce through even the thickest of armor.

dungeons.boh.title.burst_crossbow=Burst Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.burst_crossbow=A tactical crossbow favored by warriors and hunters alike, the Burst Crossbow is a powerful tool for any hero.
dungeons.boh.title.corrupted_crossbow=Corrupted Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.corrupted_crossbow=This crossbow has a subtle but corrupting power that is suitable for thieves and nimble warriors alike.
dungeons.boh.title.soul_hunter_crossbow=Soul Hunter Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.soul_hunter_crossbow=This crossbow, crafted in a forge rich with souls, thrives when an abundance of souls are nearby.

dungeons.boh.title.soul_crossbow=Soul Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.soul_crossbow=The Soul Crossbow was crafted by the mysterious Evokers and Enchanters of the Woodland Mansions.
dungeons.boh.title.feral_soul_crossbow=Feral Soul Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.feral_soul_crossbow=If you listen closely you can hear the souls inside the crossbow, usually ridiculing you.
dungeons.boh.title.voidcaller=Voidcaller
dungeons.boh.body.voidcaller=This weapon calls out to souls that are trapped between this world and the next.

dungeons.boh.title.heavy_crossbow=Heavy Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.heavy_crossbow=The weighted crossbow is a damage-dealing menace and a real threat from a ranged distance.
dungeons.boh.title.doom_crossbow=Doom Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.doom_crossbow=Many thought that the Doom Crossbow was just a myth, but this time the rumors turned out to be true.
dungeons.boh.title.slayer_crossbow=Slayer Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.slayer_crossbow=The Slayer Crossbow is the treasured heirloom of many legendary hunters.

dungeons.boh.title.exploding_crossbow=Exploding Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.exploding_crossbow=The power of TNT fused with the latest in archery design resulted in this devastating crossbow.
dungeons.boh.title.imploding_crossbow=Imploding Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.imploding_crossbow=The Imploding Crossbow has been magically fine-tuned to maximize the impact of the explosion.
dungeons.boh.title.firebolt_thrower=Firebolt Thrower
dungeons.boh.body.firebolt_thrower=The Firebolt Thrower launches chaos in a chain reaction of exploding arrows.

dungeons.boh.title.scatter_crossbow=Scatter Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.scatter_crossbow=This crossbow, modified to hold and fire multiple bolts, is also a half-decent musical instrument.
dungeons.boh.title.harp_crossbow=Harp Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.harp_crossbow=Half musical instrument and fully deadly weapon, the Harp Crossbow is the life of the party.
dungeons.boh.title.lightning_harp_crossbow=Lightning Harp Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.lightning_harp_crossbow=Adding electrical energy to this crossbow changed the firing sound dramatically.

dungeons.boh.title.dual_crossbows=Dual Crossbows
dungeons.boh.body.dual_crossbows=Dual crossbows are the perfect choice for a warrior with quick reflexes in a fast-paced battle.
dungeons.boh.title.baby_crossbows=Baby Crossbows
dungeons.boh.body.baby_crossbows=While some dismiss the cute Baby Crossbows, these deadly weapons grow into heavy hitters.
dungeons.boh.title.spellbound_crossbows=Spellbound Crossbows
dungeons.boh.body.spellbound_crossbows=Enchanted enemies are especially vulnerable to the magic of these crossbows.

dungeons.boh.title.cog_crossbow=Cog Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.cog_crossbow=The gears of this ancient Cog Crossbow still turn smoothly, making it a reliable weapon choice to this day.
dungeons.boh.title.pride_of_the_piglins=Pride of the Piglins
dungeons.boh.body.pride_of_the_piglins=Found in the farthest reaches of the Nether, the Pride of the Piglins is both vintage and vicious.

dungeons.boh.title.harpoon_crossbow=Harpoon Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.harpoon_crossbow=The Harpoon Crossbow shoots harpoons that cut through wind and water with devastating power.
dungeons.boh.title.nautical_crossbow=Nautical Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.nautical_crossbow=Why harpoon one enemy when you can harpoon.. still one.. but stronger!

dungeons.boh.title.shadow_crossbow=Shadow Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.shadow_crossbow=Those who wish to use the Shadow Crossbow must train in total darkness before wielding it.
dungeons.boh.title.veiled_crossbow=Veiled Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.veiled_crossbow=The Veiled Crossbow cloaks the wielder in shadow, perfect for those who prefer to go unnoticed (and undefeated).
dungeons.boh.title.shrieking_crossbow=§dShrieking Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.shrieking_crossbow=As you wield this unsettling weapon, you might find yourself succumbing to the darkness and becoming one with the night.

dungeons.boh.title.rapid_crossbow=Rapid Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.rapid_crossbow=New reloading technology helps this crossbow fire more rapidly than those that came before it.
dungeons.boh.title.auto_crossbow=Auto Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.auto_crossbow=The Arch-Illager said the design for this powerful crossbow came to him in a vision.
dungeons.boh.title.butterfly_crossbow=Butterfly Crossbow
dungeons.boh.body.butterfly_crossbow=This crossbow moves faster than wings in flight and strikes down enemies before they see the bolt.

########################armorsssss :3

dungeons.boh.title.dark=Dark Armour
dungeons.boh.body.dark=Dark Armor, made in the blackest depths of the Fiery Forge, is worn by the Illager royal guard.
dungeons.boh.title.titans_shroud=Titan's Shroud
dungeons.boh.body.titans_shroud=The inspiring tales of the Titan's Shroud armor have passed through Pumpkin Pastures for generations.

dungeons.boh.title.plate=Plate Armour
dungeons.boh.body.plate=Plate armor turns the average soldier into a fortress but comes with reduced mobility.
dungeons.boh.title.full_metal=Full Metal Armour
dungeons.boh.body.full_metal=Full Metal Armor is destined for the great defenders of the Overworld.
dungeons.boh.title.cauldron=§dCauldron Armour
dungeons.boh.body.cauldron=The Cauldron Armor was not created with camouflage in mind, but what it lacks in stealth it makes up for in bubbly charm.

dungeons.boh.title.guard=Guard Armour
dungeons.boh.body.guard=Cheap armor made in bulk, the Guard's Armor is a common sight in the villages of the Overworld.
dungeons.boh.title.ender=Ender Armour
dungeons.boh.body.ender=No one knows where this strange armor came from but it seems familiar to you.

dungeons.boh.title.snow=Snow Armour
dungeons.boh.body.snow=A suit of armor that was tempered in snowmelt, protecting the wearer from the harsh cold of the tundra.
dungeons.boh.title.frost=Frost Armour
dungeons.boh.body.frost=This legendary armor, forged from ice that never melts, makes the wearer feel as if they are one with winter.

dungeons.boh.title.champions=Champion's Armour
dungeons.boh.body.champions=Granted to the champions of the Overworld by the free villagers as a token of their thanks for many years of protection and assistance. The mark of a true hero.
dungeons.boh.title.heros=Hero's Armour
dungeons.boh.body.heros=Only given to the highest caliber of heroes, the Hero's Armor is a precious gift from the Villagers.

dungeons.boh.title.emerald=Emerald Gear
dungeons.boh.body.emerald=As you wear the Emerald Gear during your adventures, it calls other emeralds to you as if by chance.
dungeons.boh.title.gilded_glory=Gilded Glory
dungeons.boh.body.gilded_glory=Even death itself has to pause and admire the charms of the legendary Gilded Glory armor.
dungeons.boh.title.opulent=Opulent Armour
dungeons.boh.body.opulent=Opulent Armor, originally designed more for show than for combat, thrives in the presence of Emeralds.

dungeons.boh.title.piglin=Piglin Armour
dungeons.boh.body.piglin=Wearing this Piglin Armor is almost enough to make one feel at home in the Nether. Almost.
dungeons.boh.title.golden_piglin=Golden Piglin Armour
dungeons.boh.body.golden_piglin=The Golden Piglin Armor combines a piglin's two favorite things: not dying and gold.

dungeons.boh.title.shulker=Shulker Armour
dungeons.boh.body.shulker=Shulker Armor rivals even the toughest steel plate.
dungeons.boh.title.sturdy_shulker=Sturdy Shulker Armour
dungeons.boh.body.sturdy_shulker=They say the best defense is a good offense, but good luck breaking through this bulwark.

dungeons.boh.title.teleportation=Teleportation Robes
dungeons.boh.body.teleportation=The Teleportation Robes were made by those who devoted their lives to studying the enigmas of the End.
dungeons.boh.title.unstable=Unstable Robes
dungeons.boh.body.unstable=This Enderobe sparks with static as you sashay across the battlefield.

dungeons.boh.title.thief=Thief Armour
dungeons.boh.body.thief=This armor is light, nimble, and smells faintly of sulfur.
dungeons.boh.title.spider=Spider Armour
dungeons.boh.body.spider=Spider Armor, created by master thieves, is inspired by the agile talents of the Spider.

dungeons.boh.title.grim=Grim Armour
dungeons.boh.body.grim=Grim Armor invokes a sense of dread for the one who wears it and to those who face it in battle.
dungeons.boh.title.wither=Wither Armour
dungeons.boh.body.wither=Wither Armor, crafted with the parts of slain enemies, was made to terrify the wearer's enemies.
dungeons.boh.title.spooky_gourdian=§dSpooky Gourdian Armour
dungeons.boh.body.spooky_gourdian=Those who wear the mantle of The Spooky Gourdian become the legendary terror of Pumpkin Pastures!

dungeons.boh.title.ghostly=Ghostly Armour
dungeons.boh.body.ghostly=Those who wear Ghostly Armor may feel their bodies briefly disconnect from the physical world, but are quickly snapped back to reality.
dungeons.boh.title.ghost_kindler=Ghost Kindler Armour
dungeons.boh.body.ghost_kindler=Strange flames follow the shifting form of those who wear the Ghost Kindler armor.
dungeons.boh.title.cloaked_skull=§dCloaked Skull Armour
dungeons.boh.body.cloaked_skull=Shroud your scary skeletal form with a creepy cloak, still spooky!

dungeons.boh.title.root_rot=Root Rot Armour
dungeons.boh.body.root_rot=Twisted roots form this aberrant armor, its malevolent nature evident.
dungeons.boh.title.black_spot=Black Spot Armour
dungeons.boh.body.black_spot=This decaying armor has an unsettling presence, as if observing you.

dungeons.boh.title.sprout=Sprout Armour
dungeons.boh.body.sprout=The dark vines of the Sprout Armor continue to grow even in complete darkness.
dungeons.boh.title.living_vines=Living Vines Armour
dungeons.boh.body.living_vines=This armor is made from the living vines of a plant which grows only on battlefields.

dungeons.boh.title.evocation=Evocation Robes
dungeons.boh.body.evocation=Potent magical runes are weaved into the fabric of these robes, their origins and true powers are shrouded in mystery.
dungeons.boh.title.verdant=Verdant Robes
dungeons.boh.body.verdant=Those who don the Verdant Robe soon find that they can commune with more souls than ever before.
dungeons.boh.title.ember=Ember Robes
dungeons.boh.body.ember=The Ember Robe was created by Illager Evokers to distinguish themselves from the common guard.

dungeons.boh.title.entertainers=Entertainer's Garb
dungeons.boh.body.entertainers=Defensive? Sure. Fabulous? ABSOLUTELY.
dungeons.boh.title.troubadour=The Troubadour
dungeons.boh.body.troubadour=Why leave your adoring fans wanting more when you can wow them with this inspirational outfit?

dungeons.boh.title.wolf=Wolf Armour
dungeons.boh.body.wolf=Many warriors wear the heads of wolves into battle to strike fear into the hearts of their enemies.
dungeons.boh.title.black_wolf=Black Wolf Armour
dungeons.boh.body.black_wolf=The wolf who strikes from the shadows lives to tell the tale.
dungeons.boh.title.fox=Fox Armour
dungeons.boh.body.fox=Ancient Villager tribes created this armor to honor the fox, who is a great and agile warrior.

dungeons.boh.title.ocelot=Ocelot Armour
dungeons.boh.body.ocelot=You feel a rush of pure adrenaline surge through your body when you wear this Ocelot's pelt.
dungeons.boh.title.shadow_walker=Shadow Walker
dungeons.boh.body.shadow_walker=The legendary black Ocelot was as graceful as it was deadly. When you wear its pelt, you feel like your enemies are left chasing your shadow.

dungeons.boh.title.turtle=Turtle Armour
dungeons.boh.body.turtle=The Turtle Armor is inspired by the hardy and protective shell of the humble turtle.
dungeons.boh.title.nimble_turtle=Nimble Turtle Armour
dungeons.boh.body.nimble_turtle=This armor is made from the dense (but surprisingly light) shells of turtles who lived at crushing depths.

dungeons.boh.title.squid=Squid Armour
dungeons.boh.body.squid=It was easy to make this jet-black armor look cool. The hard part was securing the ink sacs.
dungeons.boh.title.glow_squid=Glow Squid Armour
dungeons.boh.body.glow_squid=Those who hunt elusive glow squids wear this armor to blend in with their beautiful prey.

dungeons.boh.title.phantom=Phantom Armour
dungeons.boh.body.phantom=This armor, crafted from the bones of Phantoms, is a terrifying sight on the battlefield.
dungeons.boh.title.frost_bite=Frost Bite Armour
dungeons.boh.body.frost_bite=Frost Bite remembers the icy winds which once flowed beneath the wings of mighty Phantoms.

dungeons.boh.title.beenest=Beenest Armour
dungeons.boh.body.beenest=There always seems to be a slight buzz around the Beenest Armor. Or maybe the buzz is coming from within?
dungeons.boh.title.beehive=Beehive Armour
dungeons.boh.body.beehive=The Beehive Armor hums with the focused power of countless bees.

dungeons.boh.title.soul=Soul Robe
dungeons.boh.body.soul=In a particular light, the souls woven into the cloth of the Soul Robe shimmer with power.
dungeons.boh.title.souldancer=Souldancer Robe
dungeons.boh.body.souldancer=The Souldancer Robe comes alive in the light, as if the souls within are dancing for all eternity.

dungeons.boh.title.battle=Battle Robe
dungeons.boh.body.battle=The Battle Robe is worn by the distinguished Illager Evokers of the Arch-Illager's court.
dungeons.boh.title.splendid=Splendid Robe
dungeons.boh.body.splendid=The distinguished Splendid Robe is worn by the hardened Illager warriors who protect the Arch-Illager.

dungeons.boh.title.spelunker=Spelunker Armour
dungeons.boh.body.spelunker=The Spelunker Armor is worn by those who brave the darkest depths of the Overworld.
dungeons.boh.title.cave_crawler=Cave Crawler
dungeons.boh.body.cave_crawler=The Cave Crawler armor has been passed down through generations of brave spelunkers and miners.
dungeons.boh.title.sweet_tooth=§dSweet Tooth Armour
dungeons.boh.body.sweet_tooth=This armor may look like a piece of cake to your enemies, but it is surprisingly durable in battle. Must be the fondant.

dungeons.boh.title.mercenary=Mercenary Armour
dungeons.boh.body.mercenary=Mercenary Armor, favored by those looking to save some coin, lacks flair but gets the job done.
dungeons.boh.title.renegade=Renegade Armour
dungeons.boh.body.renegade=Renegade Armor made a fine payment for mercenaries hired to protect the villages against Illagers.
dungeons.boh.title.hungry_horror=§dHungry Horror Armour
dungeons.boh.body.hungry_horror=When you wear this cloak, the sounds of screams fill the air. But are the screams yours, or your enemies'?
dungeons.boh.title.hungriest_horror=§dHungriest Horror Armour
dungeons.boh.body.hungriest_horror=Donning this armor brings great power, but along with that power comes a hunger that can never be satisfied...

dungeons.boh.title.climbing=Climbing Gear
dungeons.boh.body.climbing=This sturdy Climbing Gear is perfect for braving the blistering cold of the icy mountain face.
dungeons.boh.title.rugged_climbing=Rugged Climbing Gear
dungeons.boh.body.rugged_climbing=Take on the worst that nature can throw at you in this rugged armor.
dungeons.boh.title.goat=Goat Gear
dungeons.boh.body.goat=Made from the pelts of Mountain Goats, you'll feel like skipping from peak to peak in this Goat Gear.

dungeons.boh.title.reinforced_mail=Reinforced Mail
dungeons.boh.body.reinforced_mail=Mostly worn by casual adventurers, Reinforced Mail is a common sight throughout the land.
dungeons.boh.title.stalwart=Stalwart Armour
dungeons.boh.body.stalwart=This reliable armor is sturdy enough to be passed down for generations.

dungeons.boh.title.mystery=Mystery Armour
dungeons.boh.body.mystery=Some blacksmiths see the design influence of Iron Golems in this property-shifting armor.

dungeons.boh.title.scale_mail=Scale Mail
dungeons.boh.body.scale_mail=This armor, crafted near the shores of a great sea, was inspired by the scales of fish.
dungeons.boh.title.highland=Highland Armour
dungeons.boh.body.highland=A wise armorer made this armor with care.

dungeons.boh.title.hunters=Hunter's Armour
dungeons.boh.body.hunters=Hunter's Armor may not be the fanciest gear around, but it will stop a blade.
dungeons.boh.title.archers=Archer's Armour
dungeons.boh.body.archers=Archer's Armor, favored by humble warriors, is cheap to make and still stops a blade.

###############artEEEEfact

dungeons.boh.title.satchel_of_elements=Satchel of Elements
dungeons.boh.body.satchel_of_elements=Mysteries surround this primordial satchel. Will it unleash fire, ice, or something a lot less nice?
dungeons.boh.effect.satchel_of_elements.0=Uses either Ice, Fire or Lightning to harm attack nearby foes
dungeons.boh.effect.satchel_of_elements.1= Freeze Duration: 8.0s
dungeons.boh.effect.satchel_of_elements.2= Burn Duration: 5.0s-8.0s
dungeons.boh.effect.satchel_of_elements.3= Lightning Damage: 

dungeons.boh.title.ice_wand=Ice Wand
dungeons.boh.body.ice_wand=The Ice Wand was trapped in a tomb of ice for ages, sealed away by those who feared its power.
dungeons.boh.effect.ice_wand.0=Creates floating ice where you are looking that explodes after 4.0s
dungeons.boh.effect.ice_wand.1= Ice Damage: 
dungeons.boh.effect.ice_wand.2= Stun Duration: 1.0s

dungeons.boh.title.lightning_rod=Lightning Wand
dungeons.boh.body.lightning_rod=Crafted by Illager Geomancers, this item is enchanted with the power of a storming sky.
dungeons.boh.effect.lightning_rod.0=Strikes lightning on a targeted area
dungeons.boh.effect.lightning_rod.1= Damage: 
dungeons.boh.effect.lightning_rod.2= Rare Damage: 

dungeons.boh.title.harvester=Harvester
dungeons.boh.body.harvester=The Harvester siphons the souls of the dead, before releasing them into a cluster hex of power.
dungeons.boh.effect.harvester.0=Creates a powerful explosion that damages mobs and partially pierces armour
dungeons.boh.effect.harvester.1= Damage: 
dungeons.boh.effect.harvester.2= Rare Damage: 

dungeons.boh.title.scatter_mines=Scatter Mines
dungeons.boh.body.scatter_mines=Set your enemies up for the surprise of a lifetime with the explosive power of Scatter Mines.
dungeons.boh.effect.scatter_mines.0=Creates 3 redstone mines that explode after 15.0s or when a mob steps on them
dungeons.boh.effect.scatter_mines.1= Damage: 

dungeons.boh.title.blast_fungus=Blast Fungus
dungeons.boh.body.blast_fungus=Only the bravest of warriors carry the Blast Fungus. Not just because of its toxic spores, but because it smells awful.
dungeons.boh.effect.blast_fungus.0=Launches 5 projectiles that explode and inflict nausea on impact
dungeons.boh.effect.blast_fungus.1= Damage: 
dungeons.boh.effect.blast_fungus.2= Nausea Duration: 5.0s

dungeons.boh.title.eye_of_the_guardian=Eye of the Guardian
dungeons.boh.body.eye_of_the_guardian=The Eye of the Guardian holds a power that awakens in the hands of a worthy hero.
dungeons.boh.effect.eye_of_the_guardian.0=Fires a laser beam for a short duration. Cancel this by switching held item
dungeons.boh.effect.eye_of_the_guardian.1= Duration: 3.5s
dungeons.boh.effect.eye_of_the_guardian.2= Rare Duration: 6s
dungeons.boh.effect.eye_of_the_guardian.3= Damage: 

dungeons.boh.title.corrupted_beacon=Corrupted Beacon
dungeons.boh.body.corrupted_beacon=The Corrupted Beacon holds immense power within. It waits for the moment to unleash its wrath.
dungeons.boh.effect.corrupted_beacon.0=Fires a laser beam that drains souls to sustain itself. Cancel this by switching held item
dungeons.boh.effect.corrupted_beacon.1= Rare Soul Consumption: 3.3/s
dungeons.boh.effect.corrupted_beacon.2= Damage: 

dungeons.boh.title.corrupted_pumpkin=§dCorrupted Pumpkin
dungeons.boh.body.corrupted_pumpkin=The Corrupted Pumpkin glows with supernatural power, illuminating even the darkest nights with its powerful beacon.
dungeons.boh.effect.corrupted_pumpkin.0=Fires a laser beam that drains souls to sustain itself. Cancel this by switching held item
dungeons.boh.effect.corrupted_pumpkin.1= Damage: 

dungeons.boh.title.updraft_tome=Updraft Tome
dungeons.boh.body.updraft_tome=An ancient book filled with illegible glyphs, you feel a strange breeze as you flip through the pages.
dungeons.boh.effect.updraft_tome.0=Creates a burst of wind that launches nearby foes upwards
dungeons.boh.effect.updraft_tome.1= Maximum Targets: 7
dungeons.boh.effect.updraft_tome.2= Damage: 

dungeons.boh.title.spinblade=Spinblade
dungeons.boh.body.spinblade=This whirling weapon spins across the battlefield, slicing through enemies in its path.
dungeons.boh.effect.spinblade.0=Flies forward for 2.5s before returning to your hand
dungeons.boh.effect.spinblade.1= Damage: 
dungeons.boh.effect.spinblade.2= Rare Damage: 

dungeons.boh.title.soul_healer=Soul Healer
dungeons.boh.body.soul_healer=The Soul Healer amulet is cold to the touch and trembles with the power of souls.
dungeons.boh.effect.soul_healer.0=Heals the user, excess healing is converted into souls
dungeons.boh.effect.soul_healer.1= Healing: 
dungeons.boh.effect.soul_healer.2= Rare Healing: 

dungeons.boh.title.totem_of_regeneration=Totem of Regeneration
dungeons.boh.body.totem_of_regeneration=This hand-crafted wooden figurine radiates a warmth like that of a crackling campfire, healing those who gather around it.
dungeons.boh.effect.totem_of_regeneration.0=Places a totem that heals nearby players. The user of the totem is healed 50%% more
dungeons.boh.effect.totem_of_regeneration.1= Healing:  per second
dungeons.boh.effect.totem_of_regeneration.2= Duration: 13.0s

dungeons.boh.title.iron_hide_amulet=Iron Hide Amulet
dungeons.boh.body.iron_hide_amulet=The Iron Hide Amulet is both ancient and timeless. Sand mysteriously and endlessly slips through the cracks in the iron.
dungeons.boh.effect.iron_hide_amulet.0=Reduces damage taken by 40%% for a short period
dungeons.boh.effect.iron_hide_amulet.1= Duration: 7.5s
dungeons.boh.effect.iron_hide_amulet.2= Rare Duration: 12.5s

dungeons.boh.title.death_cap_mushroom=Death Cap Mushroom
dungeons.boh.body.death_cap_mushroom=Eaten by daring warriors before battle, the Death Cap Mushroom drives fighters into a frenzy.
dungeons.boh.effect.death_cap_mushroom.0=Grants a temporary buff to Speed and Strength
dungeons.boh.effect.death_cap_mushroom.1= Duration: 10.0s
dungeons.boh.effect.death_cap_mushroom.2= Rare Duration: 15.0s

dungeons.boh.title.boots_of_swiftness=Boots of Swiftness
dungeons.boh.body.boots_of_swiftness=Boots blessed with enchantments to allow for swift movements. Useful in uncertain times such as these.
dungeons.boh.effect.boots_of_swiftness.0=Grants a temporary buff to the users Speed
dungeons.boh.effect.boots_of_swiftness.1= Duration: 3.0s
dungeons.boh.effect.boots_of_swiftness.2= Rare Duration: 4.5s

dungeons.boh.title.ghost_cloak=Ghost Cloak
dungeons.boh.body.ghost_cloak=The souls trapped within the Ghost Cloak are protective, but they radiate a sense of melancholy.
dungeons.boh.effect.ghost_cloak.0=User becomes invisible, also grants a temporary buff to Speed and Resistance
dungeons.boh.effect.ghost_cloak.1= Duration: 2.0s
dungeons.boh.effect.ghost_cloak.2= Speed Boost: 20%%
dungeons.boh.effect.ghost_cloak.3= Rare Speed Boost: 40%%

dungeons.boh.title.light_feather=Light Feather
dungeons.boh.body.light_feather=No one knows what mysterious creature this feather came from, but it is as beautiful and powerful.
dungeons.boh.effect.light_feather.0=Launches the user forward, granting temporary invulnerability and stunning mobs
dungeons.boh.effect.light_feather.1= Invulnerability Duration: 1.25s

dungeons.boh.title.totem_of_shielding=Totem of Shielding
dungeons.boh.body.totem_of_shielding=This totem radiates powerful energy that bursts forth as a protective shield around those near it.
dungeons.boh.effect.totem_of_shielding.0=Places a totem that reduces damage taken from nearby players and deflects incoming projectiles
dungeons.boh.effect.totem_of_shielding.1= Duration: 12.0s
dungeons.boh.effect.totem_of_shielding.2= Damage Resistance: 20%%

dungeons.boh.title.totem_of_casting=Totem of Casting
dungeons.boh.body.totem_of_casting=All who are near this totem feel an invigorating aura around their artifacts.
dungeons.boh.effect.totem_of_casting.0=Places a totem that shortens the cooldown of artefacts used by nearby players
dungeons.boh.effect.totem_of_casting.1= Duration: 13.0s
dungeons.boh.effect.totem_of_casting.2= Cooldown Reduction: 70%%

dungeons.boh.title.totem_of_soul_protection=Totem of Soul Protection
dungeons.boh.body.totem_of_soul_protection=This totem radiates powerful protective magic that hungers for souls.
dungeons.boh.effect.totem_of_soul_protection.0=Places a totem that prevents nearby players from dying by consuming their excess Souls
dungeons.boh.effect.totem_of_soul_protection.1= Duration: 20.0s
dungeons.boh.effect.totem_of_soul_protection.2= Revival Cost: 10 Souls

dungeons.boh.title.satchel_of_snacks=Satchel of Snacks
dungeons.boh.body.satchel_of_snacks=The Satchel of Snacks provides a treat when you need it most!
dungeons.boh.effect.satchel_of_snacks.0=Restores a variable amount of health and hunger
dungeons.boh.effect.satchel_of_snacks.1= Maxmium Heal: 
dungeons.boh.effect.satchel_of_snacks.2= Maxmium Hunger: 
dungeons.boh.effect.satchel_of_snacks.3= Rare Maxmium Hunger: 

dungeons.boh.title.satchel_of_elixirs=Satchel of Elixirs
dungeons.boh.body.satchel_of_elixirs=The Satchel of Elixirs always contains the exact potions you need! (Well, at least the potions it thinks you need, which is still pretty helpful.)
dungeons.boh.effect.satchel_of_elixirs.0=Grants a random potion effect
dungeons.boh.effect.satchel_of_elixirs.1= Strength Duration: 20.0s
dungeons.boh.effect.satchel_of_elixirs.2= Speed Duration: 27.5s
dungeons.boh.effect.satchel_of_elixirs.3= Shadow Duration: 9.0s

dungeons.boh.title.powershaker=Powershaker
dungeons.boh.body.powershaker=The Powershaker is a smashing good time, though it may not be as fun for your enemies.
dungeons.boh.effect.powershaker.0=Next 5 attacks deal increased damage and hit nearby targets
dungeons.boh.effect.powershaker.1= Duration: 15.0s
dungeons.boh.effect.powershaker.2= Rare Duration: 20.0s

dungeons.boh.title.shadow_shifter=Shadow Shifter
dungeons.boh.body.shadow_shifter=The Shadow Shifter grants you Shadow Form, which allows you to stay out of sight.
dungeons.boh.effect.shadow_shifter.0=Grants Shadow Form, making you invisible and extremely strong for one attack
dungeons.boh.effect.shadow_shifter.1= Duration: 11.0s
dungeons.boh.effect.shadow_shifter.2= Rare Duration: 17.0s

dungeons.boh.title.shock_powder=Shock Powder
dungeons.boh.body.shock_powder=Shock Powder is a reliable tool for those who wish to make a swift exit.
dungeons.boh.effect.shock_powder.0=Stuns nearby targets, restricting movement
dungeons.boh.effect.shock_powder.1= Duration: 3.5s
dungeons.boh.effect.shock_powder.2= Rare Duration: 6.0s

dungeons.boh.title.gong_of_weakening=Gong of Weakening
dungeons.boh.body.gong_of_weakening=This ancient gong, marked with the symbols of a nameless kingdom, feels safe in your hands but emits a menacing hum to those nearby.
dungeons.boh.effect.gong_of_weakening.0=Nearby enemies become weaker and take more damage from attacks
dungeons.boh.effect.gong_of_weakening.1= Duration: 5.0s
dungeons.boh.effect.gong_of_weakening.2= Rare Duration: 10.0s

dungeons.boh.title.wind_horn=Wind Horn
dungeons.boh.body.wind_horn=When the Wind Horn echoes throughout the forests of the Overworld the creatures of the night tremble with fear.
dungeons.boh.effect.wind_horn.0=Nearby mobs are launched away and are slowed down briefly
dungeons.boh.effect.wind_horn.1= Launch Distance: 8.0 Blocks
dungeons.boh.effect.wind_horn.2= Rare Launch Distance: 11.0 Blocks

dungeons.boh.title.corrupted_seeds=Corrupted Seeds
dungeons.boh.body.corrupted_seeds=A pouch of poisonous corrupted seeds which grow into spiky grapple vines, entangling and slowly draining the life from its victims.
dungeons.boh.effect.corrupted_seeds.0=Poisons and slows nearby mobs
dungeons.boh.effect.corrupted_seeds.1= Duration: 8.0s

dungeons.boh.title.love_medallion=Love Medallion
dungeons.boh.body.love_medallion=A spell radiates from this trinket, enchanting those nearby into a trance where they must protect the holder of the medallion at all costs.
dungeons.boh.effect.love_medallion.0=Up to 2 nearby mobs can become loyal to you, following you and helping fights. When the effect wears off, these mobs die
dungeons.boh.effect.love_medallion.1= Duration: 20.0s

dungeons.boh.title.enchanters_tome=Enchanter's Tome
dungeons.boh.body.enchanters_tome=Meant only to be wielded by Enchanters, the magic of this artifact can summon powerful enchantments.
dungeons.boh.effect.enchanters_tome.0=Nearby mobs you summoned using artefacts become Enchanted for a limited time
dungeons.boh.effect.enchanters_tome.1=Interacting with a player will enchant them too.
dungeons.boh.effect.enchanters_tome.2= Enchantment Duration: 20.0s

dungeons.boh.title.enchanted_grass=Enchanted Grass
dungeons.boh.body.enchanted_grass=Just as there are powerful heroes who answer the call to fight, there are powerful enchanted sheep who will join the fight when summoned.
dungeons.boh.effect.enchanted_grass.0=Spawns a tamed Sheep that attacks with either fire, poison or speed effects
dungeons.boh.effect.enchanted_grass.1= Summon Duration: 32.0s

dungeons.boh.title.buzzy_nest=Buzzy Nest
dungeons.boh.body.buzzy_nest=Bee lovers and the bee-loved alike are fans of the Buzzy Nest, but don't be fooled by the cute bees within - they pack a powerful sting!
dungeons.boh.effect.buzzy_nest.0=Places a Beenest that will spawn a tamed Bee every 5.0 - 8.0s
dungeons.boh.effect.buzzy_nest.1= Nest Duration: 30.1s
dungeons.boh.effect.buzzy_nest.2= Bee Summon Duration: 12.0s

dungeons.boh.title.golem_kit=Golem Kit
dungeons.boh.body.golem_kit=Iron Golems have always protected the Villagers of the Overworld. Their numbers are dwindling as a result of the Arch-Illager's war.
dungeons.boh.effect.golem_kit.0=Spawns a tamed Iron Golem to fight off monsters
dungeons.boh.effect.golem_kit.1= Summon Duration: 50.0s

dungeons.boh.title.soul_lantern=Soulfire Lantern
dungeons.boh.body.soul_lantern=This lantern, still covered in the sands of some far-flung place, allows those who hold it to summon a creature formed from bound souls.
dungeons.boh.effect.soul_lantern.0=Spawns a tamed Soul Wizard to help fight
dungeons.boh.effect.soul_lantern.1= Summon Duration: 40.0s

dungeons.boh.title.vexing_chant=Vexing Chant
dungeons.boh.body.vexing_chant=Summons Guardian Vexes who will fight by your side for a short time.
dungeons.boh.effect.vexing_chant.0=Summons 3 tamed Vexes to fight off monsters
dungeons.boh.effect.vexing_chant.1= Summon Duration: 32.0s

dungeons.boh.title.tasty_bone=Tasty Bone
dungeons.boh.body.tasty_bone=You hear distant howling as you hold the Tasty Bone in your hand.
dungeons.boh.effect.tasty_bone.0=Summons a tamed Wolf to fight monsters
dungeons.boh.effect.tasty_bone.1= Summon Duration: 28.0s

dungeons.boh.title.wonderful_wheat=Wonderful Wheat
dungeons.boh.body.wonderful_wheat=This item has the faint smell of an open field, baked bread, and freshly cut crops.
dungeons.boh.effect.wonderful_wheat.0=Summons a tamed Llama to fight monsters
dungeons.boh.effect.wonderful_wheat.1= Summon Duration: 40.0s

dungeons.boh.title.tome_of_duplication=Tome of Duplication
dungeons.boh.body.tome_of_duplication=A magical tome which when read is capable of duplicating magical and practical effects!
dungeons.boh.effect.tome_of_duplication.0=Copies the effect of the previously used artefact, effect required is indicated by the HUD
dungeons.boh.effect.tome_of_duplication.1= Standard: Replicates regular effect of copied Artefact
dungeons.boh.effect.tome_of_duplication.2= Rare: Replicates rare effect of copied Artefact

dungeons.boh.title.reeling_rod=Reeling Rod
dungeons.boh.body.reeling_rod=The trusted companion of any true adventurer, the Reeling Rod is useful for more than just fishing.
dungeons.boh.effect.reeling_rod.0=Pulls a targeted mob towards you, stunning them temporarily
dungeons.boh.effect.reeling_rod.1= Stun Duration: 2.0s

dungeons.boh.title.firework_quiver=Fireworks Quiver
dungeons.boh.body.firework_quiver=The explosive power of the TNT combined with the high velocity movement of an arrow - what could possibly go wrong?
dungeons.boh.effect.firework_quiver.0=Next standard arrow that is fired will transform to a Firework Arrow. Cooldown begins after arrow is shot.
dungeons.boh.effect.firework_quiver.1= Contained Arrows: 1

dungeons.boh.title.flaming_quiver=Flaming Quiver
dungeons.boh.body.flaming_quiver=This quiver is filled with the deadliest of arrows.
dungeons.boh.effect.flaming_quiver.0=Replaces regular arrows with Burning Arrows. Cooldown begins after all arrows are shot.
dungeons.boh.effect.flaming_quiver.1= Common Arrow Count: 5
dungeons.boh.effect.flaming_quiver.2= Rare Arrow Count: 9

dungeons.boh.title.harpoon_quiver=Harpoon Quiver
dungeons.boh.body.harpoon_quiver=This quiver holds a number of harpoons that swiftly pierce through enemies on land or underwater.
