##game loading
dungeons:tips.game.1=Diamond Dust can be used to craft any Artefact, but the ones obtained from bosses will be stronger!
dungeons:tips.game.2=Unique Weapons can be duplicated using a Blue Print in a crafting table
dungeons:tips.game.3=6 Enchanted Eyes of Ender are required to awaken the ultimate boss..
dungeons:tips.game.4=Every boss has its own chest full of unique items you wont find elsewhere!
dungeons:tips.game.5=You can pay the Piglin Merchant to restock it's trades, but do it too much and it might overcharge you!
dungeons:tips.game.6=The Piglin Merchant will gild armour items for 1/4 of the price.
dungeons:tips.game.7=A Netherite Grindstone can be used to salvage items into materials and Enchanted Runes
dungeons:tips.game.8=Enchanted Runes can be used to open a portal to an Ancient Hunts - WIll you be able to discover all 26?
dungeons:tips.game.9=An Ancient Portal requires exactly 6 frame blocks, though not all of them must be filled
dungeons:tips.game.10=Some weapons, like Daggers, will automatically perform a secondary strike after you attack.
dungeons:tips.game.11=The Attack Speed of heavy weapons can be increased with Thief or Mercenary Armours
dungeons:tips.game.12=Climbing Gear will reduce damage taken from big falls and halve any knockback from attacks.
dungeons:tips.game.13=Blue Magma blocks support your breath for even longer!
dungeons:tips.game.14=The Book of Heroes gives important details about all the equipment you might find.
dungeons:tips.game.15=Scythes make for a great farming tool... you can use them for killing, too.
dungeons:tips.game.16=Animals do not have souls.
dungeons:tips.game.17=You can only carry up to 100 Souls, though that number can be raised with help from Gilded Armour
dungeons:tips.game.18=Rumour has it, the Redstone Monstrosity can transform from Bad Omen during the spookiest month of the year...
dungeons:tips.game.19=Geomancers suck.
dungeons:tips.game.20=Each Boss has two trophies - A painting and a Statue/Decoration. Good luck collecting them all!
dungeons:tips.game.21=During an Ancient Hunt, pick up as much Ancient Gold as you can find!
dungeons:tips.game.22=Follow the mushrooms.. Follow the mushrooms..
dungeons:tips.game.23=Remember, in Mushroom Fields, always beware of ???
dungeons:tips.game.24=When a mob is stunned, it cannot attack or launch projectiles - Certain mobs may even struggle to fly
dungeons:tips.game.25=Certain doors in Ancient Hunts will be locked behind Trial Spawners or Key Golems
dungeons:tips.game.26=Iceologer's can stun mobs when their ice chunks land, so be careful!
dungeons:tips.game.27=You can reduce an Artefact's cooldown using Evocation Robes or a Totem of Casting
dungeons:tips.game.28=This Add-On was made by a European, not an American, it is spelled "Artefact" here, not "Artifact", so STOP telling me it is spelled wrong >:(
dungeons:tips.game.29=The Nameless One has powerful magical attacks that deal damage through regular armour.
dungeons:tips.game.30=If a boss is invulnerable, it's healthbar changes appearance.
dungeons:tips.game.31=To defeat the Tempest Golem, try to deactive its wind totems by standing around them.
dungeons:tips.game.32=The Laser Beams shot by the Heart of Ender will deal damage to you even when you are normally invulnerable.
dungeons:tips.game.33=Enchanted Mobs drop 400% more Experience Points.
dungeons:tips.game.34=Wildfire mobs have 4 shields that protect them, you must damage these enough before you can harm the wildfire itself.
dungeons:tips.game.35=During Ancient Hunts, minibosses drop alot more gold.
dungeons:tips.game.36=On higher difficulties, expect to run into special mobs during a Raid!
dungeons:tips.game.37=Trial Arena's are dotted around the world, with totems that deal special damage during the encounter.
dungeons:tips.game.38=There is over 6000+ types of Mystery Armour!
dungeons:tips.game.39=Snarelings shoot a slime that prevents you from moving, so avoid them at all costs!
dungeons:tips.game.40=The End may be a little more hostile than you remember.
dungeons:tips.game.41=Cutlasses and Cleaving Axes are both effective at disabling shields.
dungeons:tips.game.42=Harpoon Arrows can be used to shoot mobs underwater with perfect accuracy.
dungeons:tips.game.43=Bubble Bows will trap mobs if you fire a charged shot.
dungeons:tips.game.44=You can shear a Mossy Zombie!
dungeons:tips.game.45=Thank you Alylica!
dungeons:tips.game.46=Did you know Alylica's Dungeons works in certain other languages?
dungeons:tips.game.47=Gravity effects can pull you in much easier if you are in the air!

